WEBVTT

00:01.213 --> 00:04.983
<i>It seems today that all you see</i>

00:04.984 --> 00:08.286
<i>Is violence in movies and sex on TV</i>

00:08.287 --> 00:11.722
<i>But where are those
good old-fashioned values</i>

00:11.723 --> 00:14.793
<i>On which we used to rely?</i>

00:14.794 --> 00:18.263
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

00:18.264 --> 00:21.662
<i>Lucky there's a man
who positively can do</i>

00:21.663 --> 00:23.228
<i>All the things that make us</i>

00:23.229 --> 00:24.866
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:24.867 --> 00:30.310
<i>He's... a... Fam... ily... Guy!</i>

00:38.084 --> 00:40.584
Hold the door.

00:40.585 --> 00:44.121
Great. It's that guy I only have
one thing in common with.

00:44.122 --> 00:46.992
Hey, Peter. How about
that gay encounter we had?

00:46.993 --> 00:48.793
God, every time with this guy.

00:48.794 --> 00:50.529
I'm gonna take the stairs.

00:55.475 --> 00:58.912
Oh, my God, I'm never gonna
get up these stairs.

01:00.347 --> 01:01.748
Okay, it's all right.

01:01.749 --> 01:03.883
I do this every week
in the opening credits.

01:03.884 --> 01:05.751
All right, let's see. How does that go?

01:05.752 --> 01:08.254
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

01:08.255 --> 01:11.075
<i>Lucky there's... a man who</i>

01:11.754 --> 01:13.593
<i>Positively can do</i>

01:13.594 --> 01:15.594
<i>All the things that make us...</i>

01:17.764 --> 01:20.266
I swear he says the F-word.

01:22.270 --> 01:24.070
Everything hurts.

01:24.071 --> 01:25.838
Everything's wet.

01:25.839 --> 01:28.007
I'm just gonna stay here.

01:28.008 --> 01:30.444
<i>Was Labyrinth a good movie?</i>

01:30.445 --> 01:32.546
I can't remember.

01:32.547 --> 01:35.114
I don't want to watch it again, though.

01:35.115 --> 01:37.349
Seems like a chore.

01:37.350 --> 01:40.620
Aw, even Slinky from Accounting
can make it up the stairs.

01:40.621 --> 01:42.789
Don't forget to turn in
your time card, Peter.

01:42.790 --> 01:44.757
What are you, allergic to money?

01:44.758 --> 01:46.859
Ha ha. No. No, I want to get paid.

01:46.860 --> 01:48.195
Just forgot.

01:48.196 --> 01:50.197
Ugh, look at me.

01:50.198 --> 01:53.300
I haven't felt this out of shape
since I took surfing lessons.

01:53.301 --> 01:54.967
Boy, this is harder than I thought.

01:54.968 --> 01:56.703
My arms are getting really tired.

01:56.704 --> 01:58.805
Nah, you're fine. Just keep goin'.

01:58.806 --> 02:01.741
Tai, your positivity is infectious!

02:01.742 --> 02:03.877
All right, P-Town, wave comin' in.

02:03.878 --> 02:07.381
I'm just gonna give you a little
push, and you just stand up.

02:26.234 --> 02:29.735
Okay, so, welcome to the first meeting

02:29.736 --> 02:32.712
of our women's
creative writing workshop.

02:33.607 --> 02:35.610
Ladies.

02:37.344 --> 02:39.513
Okay, Donna, you want to read yours?

02:39.514 --> 02:40.992
Oh, I didn't do mine.

02:40.993 --> 02:44.683
Wha...? Well, then you can't
have any more snacks.

02:44.684 --> 02:46.086
You just can't.

02:46.087 --> 02:47.920
Well, I guess it's my turn.

02:47.921 --> 02:50.323
"Louise lowered her velvet hood,

02:50.324 --> 02:52.759
"letting loose her flowing red hair.

02:52.760 --> 02:56.195
"Ignoring her friends' obvious
and understandable envy,

02:56.196 --> 02:59.431
"she confidently approached
the mysterious castle.

02:59.432 --> 03:00.866
"The doors blew open,

03:00.867 --> 03:03.537
"as if some magical force
had been expecting her.

03:03.538 --> 03:05.472
"Louise belonged here,

03:05.473 --> 03:08.707
"if only because this is where
Horatio called home.

03:08.708 --> 03:11.811
"Then, through the vegetation,
and past the mist

03:11.812 --> 03:15.549
"that sprinkled
her heaving bosom, she saw him.

03:15.550 --> 03:20.052
"Horatio, with his long, flowing
hair blowing in the breeze,

03:20.053 --> 03:22.222
"his cape fluttering.

03:22.223 --> 03:23.723
"He had only two loves

03:23.724 --> 03:27.860
"in his life: his horses
and Louise's heaving bosom.

03:27.861 --> 03:31.063
"He grabbed her tighter than
she'd ever been held before.

03:31.064 --> 03:34.401
"A way in which her husband,
Paulter, had not held her

03:34.402 --> 03:36.468
"since before they were married.

03:36.469 --> 03:38.572
"Horatio then took Louise by the hand,

03:38.573 --> 03:42.241
"leading her out to his stables
as her bosom heaved.

03:42.242 --> 03:44.711
"Louise's mind was racing
in anticipation

03:44.712 --> 03:48.247
"of the dirty hay sex that was
gonna most definitely happen.

03:48.248 --> 03:50.584
"As the two lovers entangled into one

03:50.585 --> 03:52.885
"atop the probably peed-on hay,

03:52.886 --> 03:54.920
"Louise's bosom heaved.

03:54.921 --> 03:57.056
"They spent the next 18 minutes

03:57.057 --> 04:00.493
