in the throes of ecstasy.

04:00.494 --> 04:02.195
Heaving bosom."

04:02.196 --> 04:05.532
- Damn, that's steamy, Lois.
- Really?

04:05.533 --> 04:08.001
<i>Uh, yeah, really. Phew!</i>

04:08.002 --> 04:10.035
Anybody mind if I open me?

04:10.036 --> 04:12.438
