and I can't move.

04:23.216 --> 04:27.889
<i>I got it. I'll do what
James Franco did in 127 Hours.</i>

04:29.023 --> 04:30.887
<i>UCLA admissions office.</i>

04:30.888 --> 04:32.868
Yes, I'd like to enroll
