not old enough to get into bars.

04:35.963 --> 04:38.601
Peter! I heard you're in some trouble!

04:39.800 --> 04:42.097
I'm stuck! I don't want to die here!

04:42.098 --> 04:44.970
I just want to go to
my desk and surf the Internet.

04:44.971 --> 04:47.608
Hang on, Peter.
I'll come up and save you.

04:49.809 --> 04:51.410
