05:22.175 --> 05:23.443
Damn it, Peter!

05:23.444 --> 05:25.578
It's just a little water.
What's it gonna hurt?

05:25.579 --> 05:26.845
Oh, God!

05:26.846 --> 05:29.181
Delete... history.

05:29.182 --> 05:30.651
No.

05:31.685 --> 05:34.521
