06:37.601 --> 06:40.919
<i>A Stable Affair by Lois Griffin.</i>

06:40.920 --> 06:44.192
Okay, another writer in the house.

06:48.195 --> 06:50.262
Oh, my God, this is amazing!

06:50.263 --> 06:52.031
This is basically a guide

06:52.032 --> 06:54.134
