07:08.883 --> 07:10.827
This could finally be my key to...

07:10.828 --> 07:12.886
To what, banging my mom?

07:12.887 --> 07:14.818
You know, you are the worst.

07:14.819 --> 07:16.355
Ladies.

07:22.330 --> 07:24.331
Ugh! You guys, this is so embarrassing.

07:24.332 --> 07:25.632
All this happened

07:25.633 --> 07:27.934
