07:50.398 --> 07:53.868
<i>Shortly after I arrived,
they amputated my leg.</i>

07:53.869 --> 07:56.671
<i>I dared them to,
and it was a big mistake.</i>

07:56.672 --> 07:59.541
<i>The other guy in my tent
